  "created": "2026-10-27T20:07:51.783Z",
  "description": "把 Ozakboy.Line 接上 ASP.NET Core:AddLineLogin() 註冊一個建立在官方 OAuthHandler 之上的 LINE Login 認證方案,自動處理 PKCE、nonce、bot_prompt 加好友引導、個人檔案與好友狀態宣告,以及 id_token 的本地驗證;MapLineWebhook() 掛上一個會先驗簽再解析的 webhook 端點,單一事件的例外不會擋住同一批的其他事件,並可開啟關鍵字自動回覆。反向代理後面請設 PublicOrigin,讓 redirect_uri 以明確的對外網址組出來而不是從請求推導。除 Microsoft 官方套件與 Ozakboy.* 自研套件外,零第三方相依。Wires Ozakboy.Line into ASP.NET Core: AddLineLogin() registers a LINE Login authentication scheme built on the first-party OAuthHandler, handling PKCE, nonce, the bot_prompt add-friend flow, profile and friendship claims, and local id_token validation; MapLineWebhook() maps a webhook endpoint that verifies the signature before parsing, where one event's exception never blocks the rest of the batch and keyword auto reply can run ahead of the handler. Behind a reverse proxy, PublicOrigin builds redirect_uri from a stated public address rather than deriving it from the request. No third-party dependency in the graph.",
