  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0: version bump alongside the core package, which gained the webhook endpoint, LIFF, statistics, rich menu batch, bulk send and further local validation. Webhook events passed to a handler mapped with MapLineWebhook() now expose typed join, leave, beacon, unsend, account link and membership data, and messages expose emoji, mention, image set, quoted message id, the mark-as-read token and sticker resource type. No change to the authentication scheme, the webhook endpoint's status codes or the claim types. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
